{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117641","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117641/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117641/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117641/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117641","id":4102790639,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7L5pMO","number":117641,"title":"Reduce contention when reading from Tracy intern table","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-03-19T16:20:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T07:10:38Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T07:10:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117641","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117641","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117641.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117641.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #117640.\r\n\r\n_(This PR originally took a thread-local approach to this problem, but ended up being rewritten. See below for the original description.)_\r\n\r\nThis changes the locking mechanism of `TracyInternTable` to not use a single global `BinaryMutex` but instead use a custom R/W lock that uses multiple (128) reader counters, specifically to avoid the cache contention that something like Godot's actual `RWLock` would suffer from in a small critical section like this.\r\n\r\nHere are the results from the MRP after this change, showing nearly linear scaling:\r\n\r\n```\r\n1 thread: 4914 ms\r\n32 threads: 324 ms\r\nIdeal scaling (assuming hyper-threading) would be 16x, but actual scaling is 15.2x\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details><summary><i>[Click to see original description]</i></summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n> This simply makes the members of `TracyInternTable` non-static, and instead makes `TracyInternTable` itself a `static thread_local`, which allows us to remove the `TracyInternTable::mutex` that's causing so much contention with multi-threaded GDScript workloads. Having `TracyInternTable` itself be a static thread-local means we can also guarantee that proper cleanup happens before the program exits.\r\n> \r\n> This will of course multiply the memory normally used by this interning by the number of threads, but given how memory-heavy Tracy seems to be in its profiling anyway, this is likely a drop in the ocean.\r\n> \r\n> Here are the numbers I'm now seeing in the MRP from #117640, again with `target=template_release` and `production=yes`:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> 1 thread: 7039 ms\r\n> 32 threads: 615 ms\r\n> Ideal scaling (assuming hyper-threading) would be 16x, but actual scaling is 11.4x\r\n> ```\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n*Disclaimer: AI tooling was used in the making of this change. Any code not physically typed out by myself has been carefully reviewed to the best of my ability.*","closed_by":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117641/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117641/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}